		{
			"id": "113359038197651907",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@tomw/113359037579632057",
			"author": {
				"name": "Tom Walker",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@tomw",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/338/280/995/838/214/original/fbcf1ae1c2f82118.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-10-23T22:14:02.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> The real achievement is to make a website that feels dog slow on *any* device you throw at it. Just an absolute mess where scrolling barely works and then the tab hangs</p>",
